{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion","id":1195925,"title":"Things One Can No Longer Do In Scion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-15T18:47:33-07:00","id":1195925,"title":"Things One Can No Longer Do In Scion","content":"In the vein of the Things One Can No Longer Do In Exalted thread, which itself is of course a sendup to the infamous Mister Welch List. List Shenanigans, or pre-emptively ban them at your table.<br /> <br /> 1. Keep in mind, Death Scions, you get one <b>and precisely ONE</b> use of the Michael Jackson Thriller Dance. Use it wisely.<br /> 1a. That's not one per session, one per story, or one per saga. That's one <b>period</b>.<br /> <br /> 2. Yes, the Kami's Pantheon Signature Purview lets you talk to the Kami of ANY earthly object. However, expect the Storyguide to put their foot down on convincing the Kami of a Trivial Character's clothing to engage in some on-demand Wardrobe Malfunctions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-15T22:35:45-07:00","id":1195975,"title":"","content":"3: There is no possible why in which attempting to put your Minotaur out to stud will end well.<br /> <br /> 4: Min-Maxing for combat is acceptable, Min-Maxing for jumping distance is weird.<br /> <br /> 5: No matter if you both hate the guy, getting a gorgon to look into someone's peephole than knocking on their door is just wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24006-dinomancer","name":"Dinomancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T23:22:58-07:00","id":1196379,"title":"","content":"6: I will not discuss shipping with Deifans or ever let the gods know about it.<br /> 6a: This is especially true for Loki and Sutekh. The might actually follow up on it.<br /> 6b: Don't ever acknowledge the Zeus/Apep one. Ever. Don't even think about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T23:36:40-07:00","id":1196385,"title":"","content":"On 6a. I'm pretty sure that already happened... And the resulting offspring may or may not have been in San Francisco in 1906, and Siberia in 1908...<br /> <br /> But then, maybe I'm just a Deifan!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T06:06:59-07:00","id":1196455,"title":"","content":"7. I will not ask if Hephaestus has ever made something for another pantheon<br /> 8. I will not offer to make Hephaestus something<br /> 9. I will not call any god a cripple<br /> 9a. Especially you know who","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23957-atlassniperman","name":"AtlasSniperman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T08:46:12-07:00","id":1196499,"title":"","content":"!0: I will not start the game with 11 one dot creatures...<br /> 11: I also won't ask the gm how many dots a nemean Tartigrade is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T13:53:54-07:00","id":1196591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vonpenguin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-o