ulation based villain using &quot;Perfect Partner&quot; or &quot;Between the ticks&quot; and &quot;Overt Order&quot; to cancel the party's Coordinated Assault is just plain dirty.<br /> 16. I may not have my villains use frankly superior combat tactics to my players.<br /> 16a. Even if the players are all blundering idiots with only two having any idea of teamwork.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23957-atlassniperman","name":"AtlasSniperman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T21:42:00-07:00","id":1196712,"title":"","content":"<b>17</b> - I won't let the party replace Aten with a girl from Jersey. The last time it happened, she immediately blew up Jersey.<br /> <br /> <b>18</b> - I won't let my party members mutilate themselves repeatedly for wisdom and power. Especially when they try to carve an entire library into their own bones.<br /> <br /> <b>19</b> - I will insist that my players with Animal stop communicating in nothing but <b>CAAAAAAAWWWWSS</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T09:09:08-07:00","id":1196819,"title":"","content":"20. If I am a Kami Scion with the Lover Mantle, I may not be of high school age and/or have all my positive Fatebindings and Followers be of the gender I am attracted to. I am not the only main character and romcom aspects get real annoying real quickly.<br /> <br /> 20a: Especially if all the other characters are of the gender I an attracted to.<br /> <br /> 20b: Double if the other <i>players</i> are of a gender I am attracted to. <br /> <br /> 20c: These rules are waived if I am bisexual, but I must have all characters passed through the Impromptu Anti-Crap Harem Comittee before approval.<br /> <br /> 20d: Little sisters will be actually biological siblings and Fatebound only negatively or as Boon Companions/Canaries/Jinxies, should I be waived for these rules. Attempting to violate will enable IACHC to retrieve two-by-fours for five minutes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T15:32:16-07:00","id":1196921,"title":"","content":"21: Beast Purview (Dogs) is fine, Beast Purview (Corgis) is not<br /> <br /> 22: Even if it's mundane item semantics wise, no amount of forge boons are going to let you jury-rig nuclear bombs","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxdev","user":"Darkfoxdev","date":". 03-18-2018, 06:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxdev","name":"Darkfoxdev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thanke