yWalker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1197009#post1197009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, I thought the munchkinry of the act would be enough to discourage it.</div> </div> </div> </div>An ideal entry on this list is something that straddles the line between the Storyguide calling Shenanigans and a Storyguide laughing and high-fiving you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T19:20:00-07:00","id":1197835,"title":"","content":"25. Kami and Manitou inhabit different aspects of the same object, and should not charge each other rent.<br /> 26. I will not arrange for both the Kami and Manitou of an object to be summoned and have them fight to the death for ownership of the object.<br /> 27. When summoning the Manitou of a door, a reasonable question to ask is not &quot;if I asked the Kami of this door whether you lead to certain death, what would they say?&quot;<br /> 28. When somebody names the Netjer Set, do not respond with &quot;Match.&quot;<br /> 29. Netjer's heads don't pop off like canopic jars. Don't ask them to demonstrate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user