er","name":"GrayWalker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T11:01:42-07:00","id":1201328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GrayWalker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1201306#post1201306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">54. Do not start a cult that believes that gods from different Pantheons are the same Deity.</div> </div> </div> </div>54a. For the nitpicky: no, we <i>don't</i> mean when a god actually does have a different name or Mantle in another Pantheon. That's absolutely fine. No, we mean things like claiming Odin is Hermes, or vice-versa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T12:59:21-07:00","id":1201366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GrayWalker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1201306#post1201306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">55. Things you\u2019ve burnt to ashes are not valid targets for the reverse engineer knack.</div> </div> </div> </div>55a. Reverse Engineer is not intended as an emergency undo button.<br /> <br /> 55b. I am no longer allowed to use the Creator Calling<br /> <br /> 55c. Or the Forge Purview. I know what I did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T13:33:23-07:00","id":1201386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1201328#post1201328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 54a. For the nitpicky: no, we <i>don't</i> mean when a god actually does have a different name or Mantle in another Pantheon. That's absolutely fine. No, we mean things like claiming Odin is Hermes, or vice-versa.</div> </div> </div> </div>54b. Especially don't do this with Thoth and Hermes. The Hermes Trismegistus incident is still a painful memory for both of them and reminding them of it is a quick way to earn their wrath.<br /> <br /> 56. Don't use Metamorphisis to grow extra arms or heads while around the Deva. They consider it rude/cheating to acquire them by ways not related to Yoga or natural acquisition and the more zealous/bloodthirsty members will most likely try to cut off the offending limbs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4983,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4983-graywalker","user":"GrayWalker","date":". 03-30-2018, 05:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4983-graywalker","name":"GrayWalker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T14:47:40-07:00","id":1201419,"title":"","content":"<b>57a.</b> Thou shalt not 'kink shame' while out of character.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>57b.</b> No, seriously. Have you ever read mythology before?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>58a.</b> Do not beseech the Devas to &quot;Fire the Brahmastra!&quot; <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>58b.</b> At least until it's a confirmed God Level threat...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T19:42:07-07:00","id":1201512,"title":"","content":"<b>59.</b> No, your Scion of Son Wukong is not a Saiyan!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>60.</b> Do not steal from Sun Wukong's personal food storage and then blame it on Sobek.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>61.</b> If you don't want the ST to pull a random plot twist out of their ass, then stop using violence to resolve every challenge they throw at you!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>62.</b> The Greek pantheon really loves tragic endings. Remember this the next time your character acts like they're God's gift to the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T21:16:09-07:00","id":1201534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1201419#post1201419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>58a.</b> Do not beseech the Devas to &quot;Fire the Brahmastra!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>58b.</b> At least until it's a confirmed God Level threat...</div> </div> </div> </div>58c. For the purposes of firing the Brahmastra, the following are NOT considered Valid Threats<ul><li>A guy cuts you off in traffic.</li> <li>Your boss just asked you to stay an hour after work.</li> <li>Someone insults your mother. (If your mother is one of the Deva, <i>they'll handle it on their own</i>)</li> <li>Your Significant Other just asked if these new pants make their butt look big.</li> <li>You saw a spider.</li> </ul><br /> 63. The Scion Slumber Party was proposed as a teambuilding event for the Band, and the game of Truth or Dare was suggested as good-natured fun. Busting out the Tongue of the Bard and Lay Geis Boons for Truth and Dares is considered a dick move.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 03-31-2018, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T15:52:08-07:00","id":1202042,"title":"","content":"64. My son of Uncle Sam is not allowed to paint his Thunderbird red, white, and blue and mount artillery on its back while blasting Born in the USA. Doing so will result in the campaign being cancelled before it begins.<br /> <br /> 65. As storyteller, I'm no longer allowed to have Forge deities create UFO's with the express purpose of crashing them into players.<br /> <br /> 66. The Blame James knack is no longer to be used to convince Odin it was Randall, the jerk at Starbucks, to blame for starting Ragnarok.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5991-akaru","name":"Akaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5991_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T18:01:38-07:00","id":1202074,"title":"","content":"<b>67:</b> It is no longer socially acceptable to refer to Medusi as &quot;danger noodles.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>68:</b> Using wild centaurs as part of a rodeo competition is also no longer socially acceptable.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>69:</b> Do not encourage Legend 5+ Giants to swallow your character whole, unless you're planning to kill them from the inside out!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>70:</b> Do not organize a quest for the sole purpose of booping the World Serpent's snoot!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-01T23:42:59-07:00","id":1202147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Akaru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1202042#post1202042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">64. My son of Uncle Sam is not allowed to paint his Thunderbird red, white, and blue and mount artillery on its back while blasting Born in the USA. Doing so will result in the campaign being cancelled before it begins.</div> </div> </div> </div>64a. Especially because... has he actually <i>listened</i> to Born in the USA beyond the chorus? (He wouldn't be the first to make that slip, though.)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T05:13:00-07:00","id":1202196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1202147#post1202147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 64a. Especially because... has he actually <i>listened</i> to Born in the USA beyond the chorus? (He wouldn't be the first to make that slip, though.)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Just finished doing so. It's really hard to make out, so I had to read the lyrics, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T07:50:22-07:00","id":1202221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1202196#post1202196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Just finished doing so. It's really hard to make out, so I had to read the lyrics, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's an alternate version from his 18 Tracks album that fits the lyrics a lot better. <br /> <br /> 65: My scion of Legba is only allowed to start his own record label if he calls it Crossroads Records.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T20:00:35-07:00","id":1202411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1202074#post1202074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>70:</b> Do not organize a quest for the sole purpose of booping the World Serpent's snoot!</div> </div> </div> </div>For the record, this is legally obligated.<br /> <br /> <b>70a</b>: &quot;It would be but a single boop on its noggin!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70b</b>: &quot;Do not boop the merry herald of apocalypse.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70c</b>: &quot;I want to boop the snoot!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70d</b>: &quot;Stop wanting!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70e</b>: &quot;But!!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70f</b>: &quot;STOP!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70g</b>: &quot;Must!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70h</b>: &quot;MARIETTE.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>70i: &quot;BOOOOOOOOOOP!!!!!&quot;<br /> <br /> 70j: &quot;NOOOOOO!&quot;<br /> <br /> 70k: &quot;NOOOOOO!&quot;<br /> <br /> 70l: &quot;EEEEEEEEKKK!&quot;<br /> <br /> 70m: &quot;*terrified/frustrated Greek swearwords*&quot;<br /> <br /> 70n:</b> *echoing squeak*<br /> <br /> <b>70o</b>: <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>&quot;...HHIIIIIISSSSSS!&quot; *chomp*</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>70p</b>: &quot;Hahaha!&quot; *falls over*<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 04-03-2018, 12:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T04:31:29-07:00","id":1202522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1202411#post1202411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For the record, this is legally obligated.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MQaDq01M-O4\" target=\"_blank\">Warhammer Text to Speech Device</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T14:25:23-07:00","id":1203138,"title":"","content":"<b>71a.</b> You can not stack more than two templates onto the same character<br /> <br /> <b>71b.</b> This is to prevent players from creating ridiculous hybrids, like Undead-Giant-Therianthropes!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>72.</b> Unless specifically listed otherwise, your companion Merits are not slaves who are contractually obligated to obey your every whim.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>73.</b> Thou shalt not tempt Fate (i.e Storyteller) by deliberately trying to fuck up the established setting during the course of your adventures!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member"