of your life!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T00:25:18-07:00","id":1203743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1203704#post1203704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Scions with a primary affinity for the Death purview should not attend funerals. It just becomes awkward for everybody.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThey should also remain in doors whenever a famous celebrity dies.<br /> <br /> \u200bAll bearers of the animal preview are reminded at this time that just because you can make giant monsters does not mean you should!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T04:47:18-07:00","id":1203790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangaholic13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1203743#post1203743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThey should also remain in doors whenever a famous celebrity dies.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 2016 was a really bad time to be a Death Scion.<br /> <br /> <br /> Scions should think twice about becoming treasure hunters and archaeologists.<br /> <br /> I mean, how would you feel if somebody broke into your final resting place, stole your shit, and then put your rotting corpse up for display in front of paying customers? The kings of the past are going to want to have a word with you!<br /> <br /> <br /> Please stop singing Edward Starr's &quot;War&quot; around Scions with the associated purview. It's making them really self conscious about their purpose in life!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T14:06:59-07:00","id":1204682,"title":"","content":"If a pack of Giants infiltrates your defensive fortifications, the players are only allowed to make ONE Attack on Titan reference.<br /> <br /> <br /> Rapacity is one of the Titans' core virtues. Keep this in mind before you decide to pull off a Magic Girl transformation sequence around them.<br /> <br /> <br /> Do not flush baby alligators down the toilet. You are a legendary being, and Fate will find a way to make those urban legends into reality!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T03:02:11-07:00","id":1207205,"title":"","content":"If the building where the fight was held in is a burning frozen ruin at the end of the battle, it's <i>definitely</i> the Band's fault, no excuses.<br /> <br /> The Scion of Sun Wukong maybe <i>shouldn't</i> be in charge of the band...<br /> <br /> a. ...no, not even when the Scion of Athena isn't available..<br /> <br /> b. Especially not if her Rakshashi best friend is with her! I mean, come on!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T06:01:01-07:00","id":1207230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195925-things-one-can-no-longer-do-in-scion?p=1196610#post1196610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__doub